.venv/
__pycache__/

# data/ and results/ are ignored except for the answers and scores (*.jsonl), the summaries (*summary*.csv) and
# the index costs (*index_cost*.json), which are small and are what teammates need to see. The first line of each pair ignores everything below the
# folder, and the "!.../" line lets git look inside sub-folders again so the exceptions can match. The raw
# UltraDomain download is excluded again at the end: prep_data.py fetches it from Hugging Face on demand.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/*.jsonl
data/mix.jsonl
results/**
!results/**/
!results/**/*.jsonl
!results/**/*summary*.csv
!results/**/*index_cost*.json

*.log
.vs/
.claude/handoff/
